  "releaseNotes": "1) Logging Improvements\n      - Changed \"for a {Elapsed} ms\" to \"in {Elapsed} ms\"\n      - Optimized Stopwatch usage\n      - Improved internal logging\n\n      2) Dependency Updates\n      - FluentValidation 11.11.0\n      - MediatR 12.5.0\n\n      3) Architectural Changes\n      - Removed AsyncRequestHandlerBase\n      - CommandHandler<TCommand> now implements IRequestHandler<TCommand>\n      - ValidationBehavior now uses IRequestPreProcessor\n      - Added TaskWhenAllPublisher for MediatR\n\n      4) Code Optimizations\n      - Simplified methods\n      - Improved formatting\n      - Refactoring for cleaner architecture",
  "repository": "",
